flowchart LR
    A[Git push] --> B[GitHub webhook]
    B --> C[application-ci]
    C --> D[Checkout]
    D --> E[Validation]
    E --> F[Lint]
    F --> G[Tests]
    G --> H[Kaniko build]
    H --> I[ECR push]
    I --> J[Trivy scan]
    J --> K[Publish tag + digests]
    K --> L[Trigger application-cd]
    L --> M[Helm lint/template]
    M --> N[Deploy]
    N --> O[Rollout]
    O --> P[Digest verification]
    P --> Q[Smoke test]
    Q --> R[Release success]

    N -. failure .-> S[Diagnostics + rollback]
    O -. failure .-> S
    P -. failure .-> S
    Q -. failure .-> S
